-09-25/20260925-autos-one-day-nine-new-cars-inside.webp","ci":"🚗","ct":"汽車","cc":"#64748b","d":"2026年9月25日","m":"閱讀時間 3 分鐘","tg":[{"u":"/zh-TW/tag/electric-vehicles/","l":"電動車"},{"u":"/zh-TW/tag/autos/","l":"汽車"}]},{"u":"/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-ai-takes-over-sophisticated-investment-scams/","t":"AI 主導精密投資詐騙","h":true,"s":"中國投資者面臨新一波 AI 驅動的金融詐騙，因人工智慧能實現更精密的「養豬騙局」，誘騙受害者轉帳大筆資金。","i":"https://img.hotnews.pub/2026-09-24/20260924-autos-ai-takes-over-sophisticated-investment-scams-v3.webp","ci":"🚗","ct":"汽車","cc":"#64748b","d":"2026年9月24日","m":"閱讀時間 2 分鐘","tg":[{"u":"/zh-TW/tag/technology/","l":"科技"},{"u":"/zh-TW/tag/economy/","l":"經濟"}]},{"u":"/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-chinas-audio-gear-makes-big-noise/","t":"中國音響設備在東南亞大放異彩","h":false,"s":"從深圳的小店到東南亞每月50萬銷量，中國音響品牌正透過調整產品以滿足當地消費者需求，在海外蓬勃發展。","i":"https://img.hotnews.pub/2026-09-24/20260924-autos-chinas-audio-gear-makes-big-noise-v3.webp","ci":"🚗","ct":"汽車","cc":"#64748b","d":"2026年9月24日","m":"閱讀時間 2 分鐘","tg":[{"u":"/zh-TW/tag/exports/","l":"出口"},{"u":"/zh-TW/tag/technology/","l":"科技"}]},{"u":"/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-chinas-auto-industry-faces-new-turn/","t":"中國汽車業迎來新轉型","h":false,"s":"四個信號表明，在中國汽車業，市場力量正在重塑競爭格局，行業即將進入新的整合階段。","i":"https://img.hotnews.pub/2026-09-24/20260924-autos-chinas-auto-industry-faces-new-turn-v3.webp","ci":"🚗","ct":"汽車","cc":"#64748b","d":"2026年9月24日","m":"閱讀時間 1 分鐘","tg":[{"u":"/zh-TW/tag/electric-vehicles/","l":"電動車"},{"u":"/zh-TW/tag/manufacturing/","l":"製造業"}]},{"u":"/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-chinas-smartphone-giants-switch-chip-suppliers/","t":"中國智慧手機巨頭轉換晶片供應商","h":true,"s":"中國主要手機製造商OPPO和vivo出人意料地轉向使用MediaTek晶片旗艦型號，標示著在激烈競爭中產業的轉變。","i":"https://img.hotnews.pub/2026-09-24/20260924-autos-chinas-smartphone-giants-switch-chip-suppliers-v3.webp","ci":"🚗","ct":"汽車","cc":"#64748b","d":"2026年9月24日","m":"閱讀時間 2 分鐘","tg":[{"u":"/zh-TW/tag/technology/","l":"科技"},{"u":"/zh-TW/tag/manufacturing/","l":"製造業"}]},{"u":"/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-chinas-lithium-battery-boom-faces-graphite/","t":"中國鋰